  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 568.02 Recipient Eligibility. All Title XIX recipients shall be eligible for physical therapy, occupational therapy, and services for speech, hearing and language disorders, in accordance with He-W 568.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #4995, eff 11-30-90, EXPIRED: 11-30-96\n\nNew. #7909, eff 6-24-03; ss by #9929, INTERIM, eff 6-19-11, EXPIRES: 12-16-11; ss by #10042, eff 12-16-11; ss by #13355, eff 3-19-22",
